{'symbol': 'NUE', 'date': '2023-01-03 09:05:00', 'title': 'NEW NUCOR STEEL BRANDENBURG PLATE MILL ROLLS FIRST PLATE', 'text': "CHARLOTTE, N.C. , JAN. 3, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- NUCOR CORPORATION (NYSE: NUE) ANNOUNCED TODAY THAT THE COMPANY'S NEW STATE-OF-THE-ART STEEL PLATE MILL IN BRANDENBURG, KENTUCKY, ROLLED ITS FIRST STEEL PLATE ON FRIDAY, DECEMBER 30, 2022."}